        "text": "Notice that \"?\" placeholders are used to bind \"data\" to the query. Always use placeholders instead of string formatting to bind Python values to SQL statements, to avoid SQL injection attacks (see How to use placeholders to bind values in SQL queries for more details).",
        "title": "sqlite3"
      },
