        "section": "sqlite3",
        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 0,
        "text": "* **parameters** (\"dict\" | *sequence*) -- Python values to bind to placeholders in *sql*. A \"dict\" if named placeholders are used. A *sequence* if unnamed placeholders are used. See How to use placeholders to bind values in SQL queries.",
        "title": "sqlite3"
      },
      {
