        "section": "sqlite3",
        "source_id": "python-3.14.7-docs",
        "start": 242,
        "text": "Raises: **ProgrammingError** -- When *sql* contains more than one SQL statement. When named placeholders are used and *parameters* is a sequence instead of a \"dict\".",
        "title": "sqlite3"
      },
